{"@type":"Process","@id":"53ffa5d2-4622-30c8-8135-e1eac2d0b268","name":"Transport, refuse truck; gasoline powered","description":"This dataset represents the U.S. average airborne emissions for operating a gasoline powered refuse truck. The inventory includes all vehicle operation processes, including off-network and refueling activities.\r\nThe vehicle operation data are calculated from EPA\u0027s MOVES2010a model, using the assumptions described in the corresponding detailed spreadsheet.  Emissions factors in MOVES2010a are largely based on EPA\u0027s Mobile Source Observation Database, which in turn includes data from a variety of vehicle studies (References 6-8).\r\nMOVES2010a acknowledges sources of uncertainty in the model structure, the population and acitivty data, and other model parameters. As of July 2011, the uncertainty calculation function of the model has not been activated.","category":"56: Administrative and Support and Waste Management and Remediation Services/5621: Waste Collection","version":"00.00.010","lastChange":"2026-03-31T16:44:08.072Z","processType":"UNIT_PROCESS","defaultAllocationMethod":"NO_ALLOCATION","isInfrastructureProcess":false,"location":{"@type":"Location","@id":"0b3b97fa-6688-3c56-88ee-4ae80ec0c3c2","name":"United States of America (the)"},"processDocumentation":{"validFrom":"2009-12-31","validUntil":"2009-12-31","geographyDescription":"US","technologyDescription":"Combustion of gasoline in a refuse truck.","sources":[{"@type":"Source","@id":"55c36137-f07a-367a-a6b5-46062d46120b","name":"National Institute of Standards and Tech "},{"@type":"Source","@id":"42c7ed98-38f6-3ed7-b347-bc2d66b3ee74","name":"EPA "},{"@type":"Source","@id":"4bd80a48-814e-328c-a963-91d1edd74378","name":"U.S. Environmental Protection Agency (EP "},{"@type":"Source","@id":"6b8aab96-3e01-34ad-8e70-be6dd4f71977","name":"Wang, M. "},{"@type":"Source","@id":"5e145cd8-7bb1-3a05-b869-99934f6860a3","name":"Eastern Research Group "},{"@type":"Source","@id":"1579e4